{"id": "art-institute-borrower-status-and-notices", "title": "The Art Institute repeatedly missed federal borrower reporting deadlines", "seconds": 60.0, "voice": "tinyvoca:F2", "narrator": "Temporary local narration", "made": "2026-11-28", "key": "671ed44c7d93c3e3", "words": 161, "beats": [{"scene": "p", "kind": "hook", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "An art school audit found incorrect federal loan disbursement dates in 5 of 58 records.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 5.43, "shot": "s0", "visual": {"type": "hook", "words": ["Dates", "in", "federal", "records"], "sub": "Earlier date and eligibility errors"}}, {"scene": "p", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "In a separate student file, recalculation increased Pell eligibility by $50.", "t0": 5.55, "t1": 10.61, "shot": "s1", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$50", "label": "Earlier date and eligibility errors"}}, {"scene": "p", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["established[4]"], "text": "The previous audit questioned $10,467 because one file lacked identification.", "t0": 10.73, "t1": 16.52, "shot": "prior16id", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$10,467", "label": "Initially questioned"}}, {"scene": "p", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["established[4]"], "text": "The student proved eligible. No questioned costs remained.", "t0": 16.64, "t1": 20.4, "shot": "prior16eligible", "visual": {"type": "doc", "title": "Eligibility confirmed", "sub": "Identity documentation"}}, {"scene": "p", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["established[5]"], "text": "Two holiday-break errors also returned $346 too much to the federal loan program.", "t0": 20.52, "t1": 26.17, "shot": "prior16return", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$346", "label": "Excess return"}}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "In 2018 one enrollment status was wrong among 62 loan files.", "t0": 26.39, "t1": 30.63, "shot": "s2", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "fy18", "kicker": "An incorrect enrollment status", "text": "Federal enrollment status", "mark": "Federal"}}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "Auditors checked the correction for that borrower.", "t0": 30.75, "t1": 32.96, "shot": "s3", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "fy18", "kicker": "An incorrect enrollment status", "text": "Correction verified", "mark": "Correction"}}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "In 2019 one status went unreported in a sample of 61.", "t0": 33.08, "t1": 36.98, "shot": "s4", "visual": {"type": "record", "source": "fy19", "layout": "table", "heading": "FY2019 federal tests", "context": "San Francisco Art Institute", "rows": [{"label": "Missing status", "value": "1 of 61"}, {"label": "Separate late report", "value": "1 of 10"}]}}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "A separate control test also found a late report.", "t0": 37.1, "t1": 39.93, "shot": "s5", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "fy19", "kicker": "Separate deadlines missed again", "text": "Late report", "mark": "Late"}}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The school also missed deadlines for exit counseling.", "t0": 40.05, "t1": 42.87, "shot": "s6", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "fy19", "kicker": "Separate deadlines missed again", "text": "Exit counseling", "mark": "Exit"}}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "The next year, 2 of 44 files had late counseling.", "t0": 43.09, "t1": 46.42, "shot": "s7", "visual": {"type": "record", "source": "fy20", "layout": "table", "heading": "FY2020 deadlines", "context": "San Francisco Art Institute", "rows": [{"label": "Exit counseling", "value": "2 of 44"}, {"label": "Enrollment dates", "value": "3 of 44"}]}}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "The audit found late enrollment dates in 3 of 44 files.", "t0": 46.54, "t1": 50.03, "shot": "s8", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "fy20", "kicker": "Two findings repeat in FY2020", "text": "Enrollment dates", "mark": "Enrollment"}}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "Borrower status can affect when repayment begins.", "t0": 50.15, "t1": 52.75, "shot": "s9", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "fy20", "kicker": "Two findings repeat in FY2020", "text": "Borrower repayment", "mark": "Borrower"}}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "Auditors did not establish that any borrower was billed incorrectly.", "t0": 52.87, "t1": 56.49, "shot": "s10", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "fy20", "kicker": "Two findings repeat in FY2020", "text": "Borrower records", "mark": "Borrower"}}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "end", "ref": ["status"], "text": "Every source is linked in the case file below.", "t0": 56.61, "t1": 59.08, "shot": "end", "visual": {"type": "end"}}], "audioStatus": "temporary-local", "audioProvider": "tiny-voca", "format": 6, "chapters": {"p": "Earlier date and eligibility errors", "b": "An incorrect enrollment status", "o": "Two findings repeat in FY2020"}, "look": "newsroom", "hook": "person"}